flowchart TB
    C["Contracts<br/>Schemas · Versions · Audit Policy<br/>Govern Execution And Evaluation"]
    PUBLIC["Public Corpus<br/>Public Cases"]
    GOLD["Hidden Gold<br/>Judge-only"]

    W_START["Workflow Module<br/>Authorized Run Dispatch"]

    subgraph EXECUTION["Execution Plane"]
        direction LR
        K["Knowledge<br/>Search · Link · Bundle"]
        H["Host Runtime<br/>Guard · Tool · Trace"]
        P["Providers<br/>Codex · Claude"]

        K --> H
        P -->|tool request| H
        H -->|observation| P
    end

    TRACE["Host-owned Trace"]

    subgraph EVALUATION["Trusted Post-run Evaluation"]
        direction LR
        AUTO["Automatic Retrieval Evaluation"]
        PACKET["Blind Packet Builder"]
        ADJ["Manual Safety Adjudication"]
    end

    REVIEW["Isolated Blind Review Boundary"]

    W_GATE["Workflow Module<br/>Post-run Gate · Ledger · CLI"]
    REPORT["Final Report"]

    C -.->|system-wide contract| W_START

    PUBLIC -->|public knowledge input| K
    W_START -->|start authorized run| P

    H -->|host-owned output| TRACE
    TRACE -->|scoring input| AUTO
    TRACE -->|audit source| PACKET
    GOLD -->|judge only| AUTO

    PACKET -->|packet only| REVIEW
    REVIEW -->|labels only| ADJ

    AUTO -->|post-run metrics| W_GATE
    ADJ -->|adjudicated audit| W_GATE
    W_GATE --> REPORT

